{"title": "Gloom Step", "pageid": 48981, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gloom_Step", "categories": ["Passive features", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:One_with_Shadows.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/One_with_Shadows.webp/300px-One_with_Shadows.webp, /w/images/9/9e/One_with_Shadows.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/One_with_Shadows.webp/300px-One_with_Shadows.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/One_with_Shadows.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Gloom Step</b> is a passive feature that increases the user's movement speed in darkness.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Movement is increased by 3 m (10 ft) when starting a turn in <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">darkness</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nimbus\" title=\"Nimbus\">Nimbus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Splintered_Shadow_Hound\" title=\"Splintered Shadow Hound\">Splintered Shadow Hound</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715102706\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 461/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1244/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 746/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth